ti-play court\nAmphitheatre\nGazebo seating\nSunset deck\nSenior citizen deck\nBBQ area\nFitness centre\nSteam room\nIndoor games\nParty lounge\nBanquet hall\nGrand entrance lobby\n\nA thoughtfully planned tower that combines space, modern construction, lifestyle amenities and prime connectivity in Borivali West.\n\nHomes are built with Mivan construction and post-tension slab technology, reducing beams and creating cleaner, more usable space inside the apartment. The project also includes 7 podium parking levels, separate fire lobby and lifts, EV charging provisions, rainwater harvesting and sewage treatment systems.\n\nIf this sounds like something you’d like to explore,\n\nComment VISIT to schedule a site visit\nor Contact 7208843259 #fypppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp #explore #fyp #mumbai #reelsinstagram](https://scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/649231938_911200101707123_4529608139784875693_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzIifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=qHHPHtV8mfAQ7kNvwEEQ7vr&_nc_oc=AdrOWGA2QUs0qwcqy9Ch8rb679QIwOO2CAQjeyV_R1jwWYG0fo5h2Muf1D-wIdVjl5E&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iev1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=jSNHpiYCm8kkoL0ZqKSViw&_nc_ss=7fa8c&oh=00_AQLYVQY6tlsk3j8UL9FjzYGcC-uL7rLOfQbGZ1N9CHSuKQ&oe=6AA5AB9C)\n\n160\n\nA new premium residential tower is rising in Borivali West, designed for people who want space, comfort and everyday convenience in one place. Located walking distance from Borivali station and close to the Western Express Highway and Metro, this property sits in one of the most connected pockets of the suburb. Schools, colleges, malls, hospitals and daily essentials are all within easy reach, making day-to-day living extremely convenient. The project offers spacious 2, 3 and 4 BHK homes designed with larger living areas and approximately 10 ft ceiling height, giving the homes a more open and airy feel. Available confi