i Pada, Western Express Highway, Borivali East at ₹3.2 Cr. Carpet area is 837 sq ft. That works out to about ₹38,232 per sq ft on carpet area. Details last verified on 27 Aug 2026.\n\nA 2.5 BHK home at Ambrosia Tower, Borivali East. Expect an interior across 837 sq.ft, complete with 2 parking. For sale at ₹3.20 Cr; connect with us for full details.\n\n## About Ambrosia Tower\n\nAmbrosia is the Project where you Experience leisure when you immerse yourself in a world surrounded by the latest technological marvels and modern conveniences with the absolute in luxury and the latest in hi-tech facilities at your service.\n\n## About Borivali East\n\nIt is Located at the heart of rapidly developing Eastern Borivali and yet accessible to all Borivali Station, Eastern Suburbs’, Shopping complexes, Restaurants, Schools, Clubs, and other places of entertainment.\n\n## Location\n\n[🗺️ View on Google Maps](https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Devi+Pada,+Western+Express+Highway,+Mumbai)\n\n## 📊 Property rates in Borivali East\n\nApartments — buy**₹30,000–50,000/sqft**\n\n1 BHK — rent**₹40,000–55,000/mo**\n\n2 BHK — rent**₹65,000–90,000/mo**\n\n3 BHK — rent**₹1.1 Lac–1.65 Lac/mo**\n\nCommercial — lease**₹140–220/sqft**\n\n[See all Mumbai property rates →](/property-rates-in-mumbai)\n\nUpdated May 2026 · Real Estate Mumbai research\n\n## New projects in Borivali East\n\n[View all →](/projects-in-borivali-east)\n\n[![Park City By Shraddha](/thumb/480/projects/33886/Screenshot%202026-08-27%20at%202.04.05%E2%80%AFPM.webp) Project](/park-city-by-shraddha-borivali-east-project-33886)\n\n₹ 27,000/sqft\n\n[Park City By Shraddha](/park-city-by-shraddha-borivali-east-project-33886)\n\n📍 Borivali East\n\n[![Chandak Greenairy](/thumb/480/projects/28522/main.webp) Project](/chandak-greenairy-borivali-east-project-28522)\n\n₹ 37,065/sqft\n\n[Chandak Greenairy](/chandak-greenairy-borivali-east-project-28522)\n\n📍 Borivali East · Chandak Group\n\n[![Rishabraj Matruchhaya](/thumb/480/projects/28700/28700-main.webp) Project](/rishabraj-matruchhaya-borivali-east-project-28700)\n\n₹ 26,026/sqft\n\n[Rishabraj Matruchhaya](/rishabraj-matruchhaya-borivali-east-project-28700)\n\n📍 Borivali East · H. Rishabraj Builders and Developers\n\n[![Press Enclave](/thumb/480/projects/28857/28857-main.webp) Project](/press-enclave-borivali-east-project-28857)\n\n₹ 27,972/sqft\n\n[Press Enclave](/press-enclave-borivali-east-project-28857)\n\n📍 Borivali East · Dhariwal Construction India Pvt.Ltd.\n\n## Similar properties in Borivali East\n\n[View all →](/flats-for-sale-in-borivali-east)\n\n[![2.5 BHK Rustomjee Pinnacle](/thumb/480/building-properties/buildingImages/12400/1.webp) For Rent](/2-5-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-on-rent-in-rustomjee-pinnacle-9910983)\n\n### [Rustomjee Pinnacle, Borivali East](/2-5-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-on-rent-in-rustomjee-pinnacle-9910983)\n\n🛏️ 2.5 BHK\n\n₹ 70,000/mo\n\n📍 Dattapada Road,\n\n[![2 BHK Rustomjee Summit](/thumb/480/building-properties/buildingImages/3975/3.webp) For Rent](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-on-rent-in-rustomjee-summit-9937291)\n\n### [Rustomjee Summit, Borivali East](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-on-rent-in-rustomjee-summit-9937291)\n\n🛏️ 2 BHK\n\n₹ 65,000/mo\n\n📍 Datta Pada Road, Rajendra Nagar,\n\n[![2 BHK Esspee Tower](/thumb/480/building-properties/buildingImages/3201/2.webp) For Sale](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-for-sale-in-esspee-tower-9903263)\n\n### [Esspee Tower, Borivali East](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-for-sale-in-esspee-tower-9903263)\n\n🛏️ 2 BHK\n\n₹ 1.6 Cr\n\n📍 Main Datta Pada\n\n[![2 BHK Ekta Bhoomi Garden III](/thumb/480/projects/3610_main.jpg) For Sale](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-for-sale-in-ekta-bhoomi-garden-iii-9903262)\n\n### [Ekta Bhoomi Garden III, Borivali East](/2-bhk-flat-in-borivali-east-for-sale-in-ekta-bhoomi-garden-iii-9903262)\n\n🛏️ 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2 Cr\n\n📍 Close to Dattapada Road,opp. Oberoi Sky City\n\n## Commercial in Borivali East\n\n[View all →](/offices-for-sale-in-borivali-east)\n\n[![Office Ra