ice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/apartments-lpt5l1433)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/villas-lpt7l1433)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/ready-to-move-lps4l1433)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/plots-lpt6l1433)\n/* Ambrosia Apartments\n\n## Ambrosia Apartments\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Divine Group](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-divine-group-d4205)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Borivali EastMumbai\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 2.1 Cr to 3.2 Cr\\*\n\n![Ambrosia Apartments](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/masterplan/40422/1540301945_Ambrosia_Apartments_site_plan.jpeg \"Ambrosia Apartments\")\n\n# Ambrosia Apartments in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Ambrosia Apartments](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/masterplan/40422/1540301945_Ambrosia_Apartments_site_plan.jpeg \"Ambrosia Apartments\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 897 sqft - 1265 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 0 Units & 0 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0 Acres\n* Possession: December, 2013\n* Rera: Rera Received\n\n## About\n\n4.0\n\n##### Excellent\n\nExperience living in the woods in midst of urban setting with **Ambrosia Apartments**, in Borivali East, Mumbai. The Park View Developers has designed this innovative luxury housing project on the Western Express Highway that will put your life at ease. The contemporary lifestyle is in complete harmony with nature as this project is a blend of both. The luxury 2, 2.5 and 3 BHK urban lifestyle apartments come with an array of state-of-art amenities. A separate leisure area for senior citizens, fully equipped gymnasium and a health club along with other fitness and recreational facilities will provide you and your loved ones with a healthy and quality lifestyle.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Power Back-up](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886956_power_back_up.svg) Power Back-up\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg) Waste Disposal\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![Security Personnel](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886528_security_personnel.svg) Security Personnel\n\n## Floor Plans of Ambrosia Apartments\n\n![Ambrosia Apartments Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/40422/40422_976_a.jpeg \"Ambrosia Apartments Floor Plan 897 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (897 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) :\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-ambrosia-apartments-borivali-east-mumbai-prop40422)\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n## \n\nA: AMBR Ambrosia Luxury Homes is an exclusive residential apartment/builder floor project developed by AMBR Construction Pvt Ltd. Known for quality construction, the developer brings over 15 years of industry experience with multiple delivered residential projects across Noida and Greater Noida.\n\n## \n\nA: The project is situated in Sector 1, Noida Extension (Greater Noida West), Uttar Pradesh. It is located near landmark developments such as ACE Divine in the Aimnabad/Bisrakh Jalalpur area, placing it in a well-connected and rapidly developing neighborhood.\n\n## \n\nA: AMBR Ambrosia Luxury Homes is a Ready to Move residential project. Construction is complete, and buyers can immediately move in or choose from available resale and rental inventory.\n\n## \n\nA: The original base listing prices start at approximately ₹34.91 Lakhs for 2 BHK flats and ₹69.83 Lakhs for 3 BHK flats. Resale prices generally vary between ₹40 Lakhs to ₹48 Lakhs for 2 BHKs based on interior furnishings and floor location.\n\n## \n\nA: Sector 1, Greater Noida West has shown significant capital appreciation, recording around 40%+ price growth over recent years. Given its strategic location near upcoming infrastructure and affordable entry points, it offers strong rental yields and steady ROI for investors.\n\n## \n\nA: Basic documents such as ID proof, address proof, PAN card, and passport-size photographs are generally required.\n\n## \n\nA: Yes, they are approved by major banks including HDFC, ICICI, SBI, and others, making it easy for buyers to secure home financing.\n\n## \n\nA: Buyers should verify the RERA registration certificate, approved building plan, title deed, encumbrance certificate, and the sale agreement. Engaging a real estate lawyer for document review is strongly recommended.\n\n## Bank Offers for Ambrosia Apartments\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_