curity  \n\nLocality Type\n\n- [x]  Upcoming localities  \n\n- [x]  Developed localities  \n\n- [x]  Premium Localities  \n\nProjects Type\n\n- [x]  Budget  \n\n- [x]  Premium  \n\n- [x]  Luxury  \n\nOffers on Projects\n\n- [x]  Properties with Offers  \n\nShowing 70 Projects\n\nClear All Filters\n\nDone\n\nNo Results Found! \n\nTry removing these filters\n\n*   [Remove all](javascript:void(0))\n\n*   [Home](http://www.magicbricks.com/)\n*   [New Projects in Mumbai](http://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Mumbai)\n*   [RERA approved Projects in Mumbai](http://www.magicbricks.com/rera-registered-projects-in-Mumbai)\n*   RERA approved Projects in Borivali\n\n*   [New Projects(70)](javascript:void(0))\n*   [Properties(1257)](javascript:void(0))\n\n![Image 1: Loader](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/mbLoader.gif) Loading Results \n\nprojectGroupSort\n\n# Page 2 - RERA Registered Projects in Borivali, Mumbai\n\n*   [List](javascript:void(0))\n\nsort by Relevance\n\n*   Relevance\n*   Price - Low to High\n*   Price - High to Low\n*   Price Appreciation (Q/Q) - Low to High\n*   Price Appreciation (Q/Q) - High to Low\n*   Rank\n\n90\n\n5\n\n7\n\n![Image 2: The Erica-Image](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2025/03/25/Project-Photo-1-The-Erica-Mumbai-5429645_410_1440_240_0.jpg)\n\n24 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n4 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**The Erica**](https://www.magicbricks.com/the-erica-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343239363435)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Hindustan Fibres Ltd.](https://www.magicbricks.com/hindustan-fibres-ltd.-buid-4d423631393035)\n\n Possession in 2026 \n\n2.95 Cr - 8.63 Cr\n\nThe building is a contemporary beauty, designed to stand tall and create it'sown special space on the Devidas Road, by way of new lifestyle landmark.The building has been purposefully planned giving you good frontage withscenic beauty, ample natural light and ventilation which will breathe new lifeand energy in your life.The project boasts of higher specifications than being offered by many othersin the industry. As an ardent follower of quality regime, the company and themanagement team is committed to take extra care to ensure that the finalproduct will be delivered in good time with excellent workmanship that willbe unmatchable.The flats are designed to be right sized with practically no wastage of spacekeeping Vastu Shastra in mind. The final product therefore, with modernamenities, quality premium fittings and rich finish will make your home arock solid investment worthy ofyour dreams.The car park has been planned with good ventilation, safe parkingenvironment and a dedicated ramp, making your entry and exit in a jiffywithout much wastage of time. Very convenient and lifesaving when youhave to enter or exit in emergency moments.\n\n...read more\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n5\n\n![Image 3: Dotom Hilton-Image](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/04/10/Project-Photo-1-Dotom-Hilton-Mumbai-5419981_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n20 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n8 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**Dotom Hilton**](https://www.magicbricks.com/dotom-hilton-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343139393831)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Dotom Realty](https://www.magicbricks.com/dotom-realty-buid-4d423833383537)\n\n Possession in 2027 \n\n1.36 Cr - 3.93 Cr\n\n## Dotom Hilton Borivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Premium commercial project with 0% covered parking, easy access to plot, sophisticated lifestyle, and 0% booking rate at launch |\n| Structure Details | 1 tower with G+6P+17 floors; construction ongoing as per RERA |\n| Electrical Systems | Power backup facilities available |\n| Locatio