y offers 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments\n\n*   The property has an in-built jogging and strolling track\n\n*   The internal roads inside the property are wide and can help in the seamless flow of cars\n\n*   There are also reserved parking facilities present inside the project\n\n*   The parks that are present inside the property are well-maintained and provide an ideal community-style lifestyle\n\n### Why Buy Rivali Park\n\n*   The project offers prime connectivity to the people, as it is located directly near the Western Express Highway.\n\n*   You can also easily access the Magathane Metro Station, which helps facilitate easy public transport access.\n\n*   Located near the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, which adds to the greener surroundings of the property, and provides fresh air\n\n*   Premium 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments are present, and you can also get 1 BHK apartments.\n\n*   The entire project is developed in a way so that it can be Vaastu compliant.\n\n*   A secure gated environment also means that your safety is always kept paramount.\n\n*   The place is ideal for families as it combines green spaces, good play areas, and social zones at the same time.\n\n*   There is a lot of investment potential for the property, and the prices of the property are expected to grow as well.\n\n### What People are Saying About Rivali Park?\n\n*   Residents mostly appreciate the green and fresh views that can be felt around the project\n\n*   Buyers also mention that they can easily access the public transport networks\n\n*   Many people state that the quality of the clubhouse and amenities is also really good\n\n*   Spacious balconies and natural light inside the individual residential unit are also appreciated\n\n*   Some residents point out the occasional maintenance and lift issues\n\n*   Overall, the lifestyle experience from the buyers and rental families is positive\n\n### Location and Connectivity Aspects of Rivali Park\n\n*   Situated on the Western Express Highway, which is a major arterial corridor offering seamless connectivity\n\n*   The project’s location is around 200 metres away from the Western Express Highway, making it an easy and fulfilling driving experience for car enthusiasts.\n\n*   Magathane Metro Station is also within walking distance from the property.\n\n*   Close to the SV Road and Growel’s Mall, which helps with your shopping and daily convenience\n\n*   Nearby, you can also find Malad Mindspace and business hubs, which are beneficial for employees requiring a daily commute.\n\n*   Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport is also roughly a 30-minute drive from the location.\n\n### Amenities Offered by the Rivali Park\n\n*   Swimming pools and a kids' pool are present inside the property\n\n*   A fully equipped gymnasium is present for people interested in fitness and exercise\n\n*   Jogging and walking tracks are also present inside the property\n\n*   An indoor games room is available, and multi-purpose courts are present for entertainment\n\n*   24/7 security and CCTV surveillance are also present throughout the property\n\n*   Reserved parking spaces and power backup facilities are also present\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Located near Sanjay Gandhi National Park, premium construction materials including vitrified tiles and granite countertops, mix of 2 BHK to 4 BHK apartments, gated community with multi-tier security |\n| Structure Details | High-rise towers with 2B+G+4P+34/35 floors, premium construction quality using vitrified tiles and granite countertops |\n| Electrical Systems | Power back-up available; specific electrical specs not detailed |\n| Location Advantages | Proximity to Sanjay Gandhi National Park, good connectivity via Western Express Highway and Borivali Station, close to malls and hospitals |\n\n...read more\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n5\n\n![Image 16: DGS Sheetal Regalia-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png)\n\n16 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n10 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**Bhoomi Airavat**](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343531303031)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Bhoomi Group](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-group-buid-4d423631323931)\n\n Possession in 2031 \n\n5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr\n\nBhoomi Airavat is an under-construction residential project in Kandivali West by Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Pvt Ltd and has a price range of Rs.5.25 Cr - Rs. 10.49 Cr. The project covers an area of 2 acres and has 4 towers with 460 apartments. The buyers will find 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK flats with super built-up areas of 489 sq. ft. to 2654 sq. ft available for purchase. The project will be completed by December 2031. Bhoomi Airavat is RERA-approved with the registration number PM1180002600498.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Key Facts\n\n*   Buyers get 4 apartments in 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK configurations.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat covers an area of roughly 2 acres with 460 residential units.\n\n*   One of the best features is its proximity to Poisar Metro Station at a distance of 0.6 km.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is still under construction and will be handed over from December 2031.\n\n*   There are eight different sizes of apartments available.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s location on Sai Baba Mandir Road in Kandivali West provides easy accessibility to the best schools and shopping complexes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is situated at a distance of around 1.8 km from Kandivali Railway Station on the Western Line.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's amenities include a grand entrance lobby and a rooftop garden. There is also CCTV security and an intercom facility.\n\n### Why Buy Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Buyers get to pick from small 1 BHK to large 4 BHK homes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is within 10-15 minutes of Link Road, SV Road and Western Express Highway.\n\n*   It offers the convenience of daily commutation as Metro line 2A stations and Kandivali Railway Station are located nearby.\n\n*   The distance to Kalpataru Mall is only 300 metres and makes it easier for you to go shopping and dining.\n\n*   The project is designed to be limited to 460 units across 3 towers to maintain a lower density than that of larger township projects.\n\n*   The multi-layer CCTV monitoring add value for residents who are concerned about safety.\n\n*   The big apartment sizes are ideal for those looking to upgrade.\n\n*   Rooftop garden space offers an outdoor relaxation place.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has its own play areas for children.\n\n*   The buyers benefit from close proximity to shopping centers for everyday convenience.\n\n### What People Are Saying About Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's accessibility by walking to the Metro Line 2A stations has garnered buyers' interest.\n\n*   Many Bhoomi Airavat reviews mention Kandivali West's established residential infrastructure and retail markets.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s price sits well with buyers looking for premium, spacious apartments.\n\n*   Buyers mention the easy connectivity to the metro and railway stations.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Location & Connectivity\n\n*   Kandivali Railway Station is located at a distance of about 1.8 km.\n\n*   The Mumbai Metro Line 2A Poisar Metro Station is 0.6 km away from Bhoomi Airavat.\n\n*   The Western Express Highway is approximately 3.5 to 4 km away.\n\n*   Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is around 17 km away\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is around 1.8km from V Mall.\n\n*   Sai Baba Mandir Road is near Link Road and SV Road, which are easily accessible by a short drive.\n\n### Amenities Offered in Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   The rooftop garden gives you ample open space to relax.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has a special kids' area as well.\n\n*   A multi-level security system with CCTV and round-the-clock security guards will ta