ent design that caters to your needs of leisure, recreation and celebration. The project is centrally located and well connected to Oberoi Sky Mall, Western Express Highway and various other important areas of the city. The project offers 2BHK-3BHK homes with sizes ranging from 199 sqft to 865 sqft.\n\n## Magathane Press Enclave Borivali East Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Strategically situated in Magathane with easy access to key amenities and transportation links |\n| Structure Details | Under construction; contemporary design; construction type not explicitly mentioned |\n| Location Advantages | Prime location in Magathane, easy access to transportation and key amenities |\n\n...read more\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n![Image 20: DGS Sheetal Regalia-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png)\n\n18 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n1 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**CCI Rivali Park Stargaze**](https://www.magicbricks.com/cci-rivali-park-stargaze-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343138303439)\nin [Borivali East](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-East-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by CCI Projects Pvt. Ltd.](https://www.magicbricks.com/cci-projects-pvt.-ltd.-buid-4d423634323236)\n\n Possession in 2029 \n\n(Call for Price)\n\nStargaze at Rivali Park - Where Luxury Meets Nature\n\nExperience a perfect blend of elegance and serenity at Stargaze at Rivali Park, featuring exquisite 2 & 3 Bed Premium residences in Borivali East. Opposite the lush Sanjay Gandhi National Park, these thoughtfully designed homes offer breathtaking views, abundant fresh air, and a peaceful escape from the city's chaos.\n\nStanding Ground+39 storeys tall, the tower showcases internationally inspired architecture, premium finishes, and smart space planning, ensuring unmatched comfort. A 2-acre landscaped podium, Vastu-compliant layouts, and 25