lan, Reviews","raw_content":"![image of Park View Ambrosia](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2018/07/13/Project-Photo-15-Ambrosia-Mumbai-5019735_345_1366_470_1080.jpg \"image of Park View Ambrosia\")\n![image of Park View Ambrosia](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Project-Photo-17-Ambrosia-Mumbai-5019735_1312_984_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Park View Ambrosia\")\n![image of Park View Ambrosia](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Project-Photo-18-Ambrosia-Mumbai-5019735_1312_984_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Park View Ambrosia\")\n![image of Park View Ambrosia](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2018/07/13/Project-Photo-17-Ambrosia-Mumbai-5019735_598_674_470_1080.jpg \"image of Park View Ambrosia\")\n![image of Park View Ambrosia](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/2018/07/13/Project-Photo-16-Ambrosia-Mumbai-5019735_575_640_470_1080.jpg \"image of Park View Ambrosia\")\n\n# Park View Ambrosia Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n## By Park View Developers\n\n## Properties in Park View Ambrosia\n\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1050 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1050 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 897 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 897 sq.ft\")\n\n## Park View Ambrosia Floor Plans & Pricing\n\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK 1317 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK 1317 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK 929 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK 929 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK 1042 sq.ft floor plan](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK 1042 sq.ft floor plan\")\n![image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"image\")\n\n## Properties in Park View Ambrosia\n\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1050 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1050 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 1000 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat 1300 sq.ft\")\n![Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 897 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat 897 sq.ft\")\n\n## About Park View Ambrosia Mumbai\n\n## Park View Ambrosia Mumbai Top Amenities\n\nThe apartments at Mayfair Sunrise in Kollur, Hyderabad range from Rs. 2.90 Cr - 4.09 Cr. It displays Greenmark Developers' extraordinary skills in building from the ground up 66 acres of upscale gated community. There are 558 of these elegant triplex villas that define living in extravagance. They range in area from 3,888 up to 6,111 square feet. They’re good for living up. And since they are near Outer Ring Road, so they can easily access to Gachibowli, the Financial District and Educational Institutes like The Gaudium School, etc. Their 100,000-square-foot clubhouse has a 6-kilometre jogging track, and they can also play beach volleyball and box cricket. If someone is looking for a place to live in the lap of luxury and in a sustainable manner, this is the place for them.\n\n### Key Facts of Mayfair Sunrise\n\n66 acres of development with 558 triplex villas. \n\nEach triplex boutique villa has 4 to 5 luxurious bedrooms. \n\nA fully luxurious clubhouse of world-class standards, spanning 100,000 square feet. \n\nFinancial District is 7 minutes from this spot and ready access to ORR Exit 2. \n\nOffer sports are beach volleyball, box cricket, and the clubhouse 6-kilometer jogging track. \n\nSustainable living with eco-sensitive 14 lush gardens and infrastructure. \n\nIt is about 7 minutes from ORR Exit 2.\n\nConstruction is currently 80% complete, and possession will begin soon.\n\nSports facilities include beach volleyball, box cricket, and a 6-kilometre jogging track.\n\nEco-friendly infrastructure and fourteen verdant parks are features of sustainable living.\n\n### Why Buy in Mayfair Sunrise Kollur, Hyderabad\n\nMayfair Sunrise is just seven minutes from ORR Exit 2. So, residents can reach Gachibowli and the Financial District in only twenty minutes. \n\nThe villas have office space and private home theatres.\n\nThe development provides superior recreational amenities inside a stunning 100,000 sq. ft. clubhouse.\n\nThere’s over 6 acres of green space and 14 themed parks within the complex. The residents enjoy pollution-free living.\n\nFull Vastu-compliant selections of ultra-luxury finishes, private elevator to each unit and more.\n\nAn eco-friendly community with solar power, EV charging stations and state-of-the-art water treatment facilities.\n\nWith infrastructure development in place this is expected to appreciate by 10% at a minimum annually considering its location in a high growth corridor.\n\n### What People are Saying about Mayfair Sunrise\n\nThe 100,000-square-foot clubhouse and the unique six-kilometre indoor jogging track have left owners in awe. \n\nBuyers, the majority of whom have a straightforward commute to the Financial District, have chosen the villa. \n\nVastu compliant villas with home theatres and elevators fascinate the affluent buyers.\n\nThe community's 66 acres of expansive greenery and 14 themed parks will offer a \"serene retreat\" for residents seeking to escape the bustle of Hyderabad.\n\n### Location and Connectivity of Mayfair Sunrise\n\nIndeed, the location of Mayfair Sunrise is excellent because it's in the Kollur-Velimela corridor.\n\nOnly 7 minutes from Outer Ring Road Exit 2.\n\nWithin ten to fifteen minutes are prestigious institutions.\n\nFor specialist care, reaching top hospitals, including Apollo (Life Sciences), Citizens, and Continental, takes only 20 minutes.\n\nRGI Airport is only a 40-minute drive via the ORR and is conveniently located close to Miyapur Metro and Nagulapalli Railway Station. \n\n### Amenities Offered in Mayfair Sunrise\n\nThe spacious and luxurious clubhouse features a library, gym and suites for guests.\n\nThe sports arena has three indoor badminton courts, beach volleyball and tennis courts.\n\nIn addition to the jogging track and parks, Mayfair Sunrise has a dedicated pet zone and an outdoor meditation zone called Nirvana.\n\nThe luxurious villa complex has a rooftop café, an open lawn for parties and a top-class swimming pool featuring a jacuzzi.\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Basement + Ground + First commercial + Recreational floor + 4 podium + 28 Storeys; Divine Space's people-driven approach; name inspired by 'divine drink of Gods' signifying immortality |\n| Structure Details | High-rise construction with Basement, Ground, First commercial, Recreational floor, 4 podiums, and 28 storeys |\n| Location Advantages | Borivali East is a well-developed suburb with good educational institutions, hospitals, malls, and civic infrastructure; proximity to recreational spots like Gorai beach and Water Kingdom |\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Park View Ambrosia Price | Rs. 2.90 Cr - 4.09 Cr |\n| Property Types | Flat |\n| Project Type | Residential |\n| Park View Ambrosia Status | Ready To Move |\n| Park View Ambrosia Launch Date | 01 January 2014 |\n| Park View Ambrosia Possession Date | 01 May 2016 |\n| Towers in Park View Ambrosia | 1 |\n\n### Park View Ambrosia Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat | 929 Sq. Ft. |\n| Park View Ambrosia 2 BHK Flat | 1042 Sq. Ft. |\n| Park View Ambrosia 3 BHK Flat | 1317 Sq. Ft. |\n\n### How is the Borivali East Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Park View Ambrosia\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"map image\")\n\n## Landmarks near Park View Ambrosia\n\n## Price Trend for Ambrosia Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n| Project vs Locality Price | Apr-June'26 | Jan-Mar'26 | Oct-Dec'25 | Jul-Sept'25 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Ambrosia | ₹ 26297 / sq.ft | ₹ 26297 / sq.ft | ₹ 26297 / sq.ft10% | ₹ 23859 / sq.ft23% |\n| Epsilon | ₹ 24069 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 24111 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 23622 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 23083 / sq.ft-1% |\n| Agarwal Skyrise | ₹ 6840 / sq.ft | ₹ 6840 / sq.ft | ₹ 6840 / sq.ft | ₹ 6840 / sq.ft |\n| Borivali East | ₹ 23087 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 23223 / sq.ft1% | ₹ 22903 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 22910 / sq.ft6% |\n\n## Park View Ambrosia Photos & Videos\n\n![Park View Ambrosia photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia photos 1\")\n![Project View in Park View Ambrosia](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Park View Ambrosia\")\n![Project View in Park View Ambrosia](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Park View Ambrosia\")\n![Park View Ambrosia photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia photos 2\")\n![Park View Ambrosia photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia photos 3\")\n![Park View Ambrosia photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Ambrosia photos 4\")\n\n## About [Borivali East](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-East-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Borivali East Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Borivali East Video\")\n\n## About Park View Developers\n\n![Park View Developers](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Park View Developers\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Joint venture of Amal, Divine Space and Options Builders.  Amal Group: Amal Group has a history of more than 2 decades in the Construction line and our development spreads millions of square feet across residential and commercial projects. With the use of innovative technology, quality products and timely delivery, the group has created its mark in real estate. Our Knowledge based approach, experienced management and a dedicated team of experts and professionals give us the edge.  Divine Space: With a 40 year presence and intensive experience in Realty, we provide products matching an industry leader level in innovation and craftsmanship. Each project is built by the best in the business to create a unique combination of style and practicality. From Commercial Spaces to Residential buildings, we provide economically sustainable solutions to every project we undertake.   Options: Options, one of Mumbai's leading fashion retail brands since 1985, has lived on the premium side of the lifestyle spectrum. They made their foray into real estate in 2005. Since then, Options Developers has succeeded in creating stylish landmarks over 40 Lakh sq. ft. that trail the suburbs of Mumbai. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Chandak Greenairy photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Chandak Greenairy photo\")\n![Fortune Florence photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Fortune Florence photo\")\n![CCI Rivali Park Stargaze phot